{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\", \"C1\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\", \"C1\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C4\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C2与C3完全相同，并列第一；它们最充分地把疲惫、无力、未解的问题和选择压力的松动连起来，C4的经历逻辑较好但重复较多，C1则对疲惫的交代不足。keep：清单明确标为无，没有指定需要保留的实质内容，四者无法区分，并列。cover：C2/C3最直接解释了B4所说的知道重要却无力重新讲述，也回应了B3的生活问题迟迟没有答案和B2的失去方向；C4有疲惫和两难，但对无力回望的解释较弱；C1主要解释了两种选择为何都舍不得。lean：C2/C3虽然有少量重复，但各条依次交代疲惫、两种牵挂、现实冲突、休息的意义和选择压力的松动；C1反复强调两样都曾帮过他，C4则在第三、四条重复说明要保护安宁、休息不等于放弃。plain：C1最像一个人在讲自己的处境，尤其是尚未解决的事仍需面对这一层，表达直接；C4次之；C2/C3的知道自己想护住什么、判哪一边错等说法稍显概括和心理分析。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9e4053cb-e763-4d89-9f80-0623978f5216", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T005744646569Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:58:22.206622+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0d3c82fab67e7ddb6f046f687a9d7faff8bc07ef29a7915a4ccac500da9d4429", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\c